cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Si usas el benchmark, el corpus o los datasets de EMAP Labs,
  cita este repositorio.
title: >-
  EMAP Labs: verifiable geographic retrieval benchmark and territorial
  mobility datasets for Euskadi and Madrid
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jiménez
    given-names: Gaizka
    alias: r3tr0eth
repository-code: https://github.com/r3tr0eth/emap-labs
url: https://emap-next.vercel.app
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21282784
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.3.0-rc.1"
date-released: "2026-08-29"
keywords:
  - geographic-retrieval
  - benchmark
  - basque
